    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `document_client.py` file, I need to write the code that provides local configuration and client helper utilities for OCR and Layout Extraction. I will use Amazon Textract as the third-party managed service for this task. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
