    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To extract tables from a document, I need to use an external provider. Amazon Textract is a service that automatically extracts text and data from scanned documents. I will use the Amazon Textract SDK to identify the provider in the code. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789865832554,
          "start": 1789865828407
        },
        "type": "text"
