        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file `extract_layout.py` that extracts blocks, lines, tables, or layout elements from a document using a concrete external provider, I will choose Amazon Textract as the provider. Amazon Textract is a service that automatically extracts text and data from scanned documents. The code will use the Boto3 library to interact with Amazon Textract, making the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
